  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\"> <br>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">提升 Minecraft 的書本體驗，一次翻兩頁。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/page_screens.png\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iZ4xf3k8h7g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/page_visuals.png\" alt=\"視覺效果\" width=\"1000\"></a>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/books_and_you.gif\" alt=\"Books and You\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">§</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡這個模組嗎？您的支持將讓我能繼續開發它以及其他模組！</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"558.73\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"191.75\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/page_golden_book.png\" alt=\"Golden Book\" width=\"1000\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">§</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">§</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">看看我的其他模組：</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt\" width=\"120\"